CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_1::
	.string "You’re a rookie trainer aren’t you?\n"
	.string "I can tell!\p"
	.string "That’s OK! Everyone is a rookie\n"
	.string "at some point!$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_2::
	.string "If you’d like, I can teach you a\n"
	.string "few things.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_3::
	.string "Oh... It’s something I enjoy doing...\p"
	.string "Fine. Come see me when you like.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_4::
	.string "OK, then!\n"
	.string "Follow me!$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_5::
	.string "This is a POKéMON CENTER. They heal\n"
	.string "your POKéMON in no time at all.\p"
	.string "You’ll be relying on them a lot, so\n"
	.string "you better learn about them.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_6::
	.string "This is a POKéMON MART.\p"
	.string "They sell BALLS for catching wild\n"
	.string "POKéMON and other useful items.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_7::
	.string "ROUTE 30 is out this way.\p"
	.string "Trainers will be battling their\n"
	.string "prized POKéMON there.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_8::
	.string "This is the sea, as you can see.\p"
	.string "Some POKéMON are found only in\n"
	.string "water.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_9::
	.string "Here...\p"
	.string "It’s my house!\n"
	.string "Thanks for your company.\p"
	.string "Let me give you a small gift.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_OldMan1_10::
	.string "Your BAG becomes more useful as you\n"
	.string "add items.\p"
	.string "I wish you luck on your journey!$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Boy_1::
	.string "MR.POKéMON’s house is still farther\n"
	.string "up ahead.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Boy_2::
	.string "I battled the trainers on the\n"
	.string "road.\p"
	.string "My POKéMON lost.\n"
	.string "They’re a mess! I must take\l"
	.string "them to a POKéMON CENTER.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Woman1_1::
	.string "Did you talk to the old man by the\n"
	.string "POKéMON CENTER?\p"
	.string "He’ll put a MAP of JOHTO on your\n"
	.string "BAG.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Woman1_2::
	.string "When you’re with POKéMON, going\n"
	.string "anywhere is fun.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Fisher_1::
	.string "A POKéMON I caught had an item.\n"
	.string "I think it’s MYSTIC WATER.\p"
	.string "I don’t need it, so do you want it?$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Fisher_2::
	.string "Back to fishing for me, then.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Trigger3_1::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "You got a POKéMON at the LAB.\p"
	.string "What a waste.\n"
	.string "A wimp like you.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Don’t you get what I’m saying?\p"
	.string "Well, I too, have a good POKéMON.\n"
	.string "I’ll show you what I mean!$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Trigger3_2::
	@ ShinyGold: overlapping data duplicated from 0x08740BC0
	.string "...\p"
	.string "My name’s {RIVAL}.\p"
	.string "I’m going to be the world’s\n"
	.string "greatest POKéMON trainer.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Trigger3Defeat::
	.string "Humph. Are you happy you won?$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Sign1::
	.string "CHERRYGROVE CITY\n"
	.string "The City of Cute, Fragant Flowers$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Sign2::
	.string "GUIDE GENT’S HOUSE$"
